{
  "id": "LUK.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahemba makūmi mpungatī na babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya yenīyo ū Seeba ūsola bahemba bangī makūmi mpungatī na babīlī, ūbatūma babīlī babīlī, batonge ū kū mizengo na a mapandī ayo walī atogilwe kūja ū wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū nīmo gw'igesa gūlī ntaale no, alīyo a batūmami bagehu; nombagi ū Seeba atūme batūmami ū kū nīmo gokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, jagi; gwike managi gīkī nalīmutūma gītī baana ba ng'holo kūja kwigulanya na mapūge! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūsola mbogoshi, nūūlū mfuko, nūūlū shilatū; hama ūlū mulīja, yaya ū kwikala ng'witūja tūja mu nzīla kūgīsha banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūshika ha kaya ndebe bagīshagi tame; ng'ūbawīla gīkī, ‘A ha kaya īyī, twang'wenhelaga mhola.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbiza alīho munhū ntengeke, ī mhola ying'we īkūng'wikalīla; alīyo ūlū atīho, īkūmushokela ī mhola ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī kaya īyo īlang'wanukūle ikalagi henaho, muyūlya na kūng'wa hamò nabo, nguno ū ntūmami shing'wigelile kūpandīka mheela yakwe. Yaya ū kwitambūkīja tambūkīja ng'hambī; kwīnga ha kaya īyī kūja kaya yīngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nūūlū ng'wingīla mu nzengo nebe, ūlū būng'wanukūla lyagi īsho balamutengele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bapījagi a basaatu baamo, nīyo ng'ūbawīla gīkī, ‘Ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu bong'wegeelaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'wingīla mu nzengo nebe būleka ū kūng'wanukūla, jagi ng'ūbīta ū mu mapanda gabo mulīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nū lūbuubu lo mu nzengo gwing'we ūlo lwadaamīīlaga kū mhambala jise lūūlo twamukung'unhīla, alīyo managi gīkī ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu bong'wegeelaga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gīkī, ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo īkūbiza hambū hambū ū kū bana Sodoma; kūtinda ū kū nzengo gwenūyo!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolomiwa kwa mizengo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlī mu kwihīga Kolasini, nū bebe Betisaida ūlī mu kwihīga, nguno ī shītwa sha koolecha būdūla būtaale īsho shabeejiwe mu bing'we ūlū ni shabeejiwa mu Tulo na Sidoni, a bazengi baamo ni bagalūka kale, mu kūzwala magūnīla na kwifudīka mu mabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ng'wikanza lya kūlamulwa, īkūbiza hambū hambū ū kū bana Tulo na a bana Sidoni, kūtinda ū kū bing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe nang'ho Kapelanaumu, ūliganika gīkī ūkūgūngūhiwa kūshisha ng'wigūlū? Ūkwichiwa kūshisha kūlimu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūng'wigwa a bing'we numho waniigwaga nene, nū wa kūmufīkīlīja a bing'we numho wanifīkīlījaga nene; hangī ūyo ūnifīkīlīja nene, hū wanfīkīlījaga ūyo anitūmile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsombooji bo bahemba makūmi mpungatī na babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahemba makūmi mpungatī na babīlī aho bashoka baalī na būyegi no; būng'wīla gīkī, “Seeba na a bana masamva twalūbapeejaga mu nguzu ja lina lyako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbawīla gīkī, “Namonile ū Shetani alīīgwa gītī lūlabi alīfuma ng'wigūlū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī a bing'we naang'winhile būdūla bo kūpanda nūūlū nzoka na ng'homi, nū būdūla bo ng'wanishi kūbūpyena ū bose; na shitīho shikolo shose shose sha kūng'wītīla mayanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū gwa kūheeba masamva gūtamuyejage, alīyo yegagi īkī a mina ging'we gandīkilwe ū ng'wigūlū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkumīlīja kwa ng'wa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū Yesu ūkumīlīja mu būyegi wa ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela; ūhaya gīkī, “Nalīkūlūmba Baba, bebe ūyo ūlī Seeba w'igūlū na sī, nguno pyī ī mihayo īyī wībisile ū kū ba masala na a bitegeleja, wīyoolecha ū kū baana. Alichene Baba, nguno h'ūmo ībeelelile ū kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Baba ashitūūlile pyī ī shose mu nkono gwane; na atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo aamanile ū Ng'wana, ūlū atī Baba iyene. Hangī atīho ūyo aamanile ū Baba, ūlū atī Ng'wana wike, na būlī ng'wene ūyo Ng'wana alatogwe kūmfubolela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbagalūkīla a bahemba bakwe boi dūhū; ūhaya gīkī, “Galī na lubango a miso ayo gakwībonaga īyo mukwībonaga a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalīmuwīla gīkī, bahangi na batemi bingī baalī batogilwe kwībona īyo mukwībonaga alīyo batībonile; na kwīyigwa īyo mukwīyigwaga alīyo batayigwile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo shitaale kūtinda shose",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa nangi nebe wa shilagīlo wīmīīla ūmūja mu kūngema, ūhaya gīkī, “Nangi nīīte mhayo kī nabize na būpanga butashilaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūng'wīla, “Yandīkilwe ginehe ū mu shilagīlo, ūkūsomaga ginehe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnshokeja ūhaya, “Ntogagwe ū Seeba Mulungu wako nang'holò yako yose, na būpanga wako bose na nguzu jako jose, na maganiko gako gose; nū nzenganwa ng'wiyo gīt'ūmo witogelilwe bebe ng'wenekīlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla gīkī, “Watūngīlīja a kashokeje, nū bebe ītaga gīko, Ūkūpīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsamalia wa shigongo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nangi ng'wenūyo walī atogilwe kwiyoolecha gīkī ntūngīlīja, na lūūlū ūmūja ū Yesu gīkī, “Ū nzenganwa ng'wichane h'ūyo alī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu wandīja henaho; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Lwise lūmò munhū nebe watulumenhaga kūfuma Yelusalemu ajile Yeliko, ohayimanīla onyang'wa na banyoli. Būntūlagūla, hama būntaaja pyī ī shikolo, nī shizwalo būnzuuja, būja būneka alī mandetendete, hihī kūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A makanza genayo, ngabīji nebe nang'hwe ūsangwa alītulumenha kūbītīla ī nzīla yenīyo. Ūng'wipumūkīja hoi, aho wamona ūtaja ūbītīla kū mhelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nawī ūshika ho a h'ipandī lyenīlo, wahayūmona ūchaalīīla, ūbīta chaawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Nsamalia nebe walī mu lūgendo ajile, ū ng'wene wahayūshika a halī munhū ng'wenūyo, aho wamona ūnsaatwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wegeela ūng'ooja ooja na mvinya a magulagīje, ūmila na maguta, hūna ūgatunga; hama ūndamhīja ha nzobe yakwe, ūntwala kū numba ya kūlaala bageni ūūkangaliila chiza kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo yaho ūsola denali ibīlī, ūng'winha ū ng'wenekīlī numba ya bageni, ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ngaliilage ū munhū ng'wenūyū; shose shose īsho ūlatūmamīle kūkīla a ha hela jenīji, nakwiza nakwinhe ūlū nalashoke.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlībona ginehe a ha gatī ya banhū a badatū benabo, alī ginehe ūyo akabiza nzenganwa ng'wiye ū munhū ūyo olī onyang'wa na banyoli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla, “Ūyo akang'wītīla ya koolecha shigongo.” Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkīīte gīko nang'ho!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbageniha ba Malita na Malia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho alī mu lūgendo na a bahemba bakwe, bakashika mu chalo shilebe. Nkīma ūmò lina lyakwe Malita ūng'wegeleja ha kaya yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo walī na ng'wanong'wawe witanagwa Malia. Ū ng'wene wigasha ha sī hihī na mhambala ja ng'wa Yesu, ūyūndegeleka īyo wasomboolaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Malita wandya kūtagamba na milīmo ya kūbalonja longeja. Nose ūng'wegeela ū Seeba ūng'wīla, “Seeba nibūlī ūtūlonjaga ī gīkī ū ng'wanong'wise onilekanījaga nene dūhū pyī ī milīmo? Ni wang'wīla anigunanhe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Seeba ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Malita Malita, otagambaga na milīmo mingī no, nose ozwangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gūlīho gūmò dūhū ūyo gwigeleelilwe; ū ngabo ūyo wagūsolaga Malia gūlī gwawiza, atūdūla kwīngījiwa na hado yaya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
